      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hartford%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Pigeon River Valley, where Hartford lies, divides the Great Smokies crest from the Snowbird massif, shaping the town’s landscape.",
